{"id":691,"name":"dragalge","speciesId":691,"dex":691,"form":"normal","generation":6,"types":["poison","dragon"],"stats":{"hp":65,"attack":75,"defense":90,"special-attack":97,"special-defense":123,"speed":44},"abilities":[{"name":"poison-point","hidden":false},{"name":"poison-touch","hidden":false},{"name":"adaptability","hidden":true}],"height":18,"weight":815,"baseExp":173,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/691.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/691.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/691.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/691.ogg","genus":"Mock Kelp Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon Simulado Kelp","flavor":[{"version":"x","text":"Their poison is strong enough to eat through the hull of a tanker, and they spit it indiscriminately at anything that enters their territory."},{"version":"y","text":"Tales are told of ships that wander into seas where Dragalge live, never to return."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"This vicious Pokémon sprays a poisonous liquid on opponents that come near. For whatever reason, it gets along really well with Dhelmise."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"It blends in with seaweed to ambush its prey and then takes them down with a poisonous liquid strong enough to melt metal."},{"version":"sword","text":"Dragalge uses a poisonous liquid capable of corroding metal to send tankers that enter its territory to the bottom of the sea."},{"version":"shield","text":"Dragalge generates dragon energy by sticking the plume on its head out above the ocean’s surface and bathing it in sunlight."}],"flavorPt":"Dragalge gera energia de dragão espetando a pluma em sua cabeça acima da superfície do oceano e banhando-a na luz solar.","genderRate":4,"captureRate":55,"eggGroups":["water1","dragon"],"isLegend